        "original_id": "81622126-6cfd-5ea4-85d4-b0ead45e8913",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tony Scott, Brian Helgeland, A. J. Quinnell\n- Music Groups: Kinky\n- Albums: Kinky, Atlas, Reina\n- Songs: “Más”\n- Films: Man on Fire\n- Games: SSX 3\n- Topics: language of lyrics, adaptations, soundtrack/features\n\nFacts:\n- In 2002, Kinky released the album Kinky.\n- In 2003, Kinky released the album Atlas.\n- In 2004, the song “Más” by Kinky was featured in the PlayStation 2 video game SSX 3 and in the film Man on Fire.\n- In 2004, Man on Fire was released as a British-American crime thriller film.\n- Man on Fire was directed by Tony Scott.\n- Man on Fire was written by Brian Helgeland.\n- Man on Fire was based on the 1980 novel Man on Fire by A. J. Quinnell.\n- Reina has lyrics sung more in English than in Spanish, unlike Kinky’s two preceding albums Kinky and Atlas.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
